    state at time `t`, :math:`x_t` is the input at time `t`, :math:`h_{t-1}`
    is the hidden state of the layer at time `t-1` or the initial hidden
    state at time `0`, and :math:`i_t`, :math:`f_t`, :math:`g_t`,
