    For each element in the input sequence, each layer computes the following
    function:

    .. math::
        \begin{array}{ll} \\
            i_t = \sigma(W_{ii} x_t + b_{ii} + W_{hi} h_{t-1} + b_{hi}) \\
            f_t = \sigma(W_{if} x_t + b_{if} + W_{hf} h_{t-1} + b_{hf}) \\
