        * **c_n**: tensor of shape :math:`(D * \text{num\_layers}, H_{cell})` for unbatched input or
          :math:`(D * \text{num\_layers}, N, H_{cell})` containing the
          final cell state for each element in the sequence. When ``bidirectional=True``,
