        weight_ih_l[k]_reverse: Analogous to `weight_ih_l[k]` for the reverse direction.
            Only present when ``bidirectional=True``.
        weight_hh_l[k]_reverse:  Analogous to `weight_hh_l[k]` for the reverse direction.
